// Journey availability, recording jobs, by failure source (DIAAT-277), by day and service.
// The cross-area figure is service_availability_journey.kql; this one keeps recording's
// breakdown by hmcts.failure.source.
// Did transcription jobs reach "transcript available"?
//
// Source: the job.finished event (DIAAT-281/282/283), emitted once per job when it
// reaches a terminal state, with hmcts.outcome and, when it did not succeed,
// hmcts.failure.source (application, queue or dependency) and hmcts.error.code.
// A successful job.finished follows transcript.available.
//
// Formula, per day and service:
//   availability % = 100 * succeeded / (succeeded + unavailable)
//   succeeded      = job.finished with hmcts.outcome == "success"
//   unavailable    = job.finished with hmcts.outcome == "error", whatever the source:
//                    application (our code, database or blob storage), dependency
//                    (Azure Speech) or queue (never processed). A missing source counts
//                    as unavailable too.
// Exclusions:
//   - Client failures (hmcts.outcome == "failure") are EXCLUDED from both sides, like
//     4xx in endpoint availability: the caller's request was rejected (an HTTP 4xx
//     raised for it, hmcts-otel's client_failure_code rule). They carry
//     hmcts.failure.source "application" only because every non-Speech cause is
//     labelled so; they are counted in client_failures for visibility.
//   - "cancelled" outcomes are excluded.
//   - Jobs that never finish have no job.finished: they are not in this figure. They
//     raise job.stuck and the transcription.jobs.stuck gauge instead (recording_stuck_jobs.kql).
// Target: 99% or 99.5% per month, STILL TO BE CONFIRMED.
//
// Parameter-free: run it against an environment's Application Insights resource. The
// time range comes from the caller.
customEvents
| where name == "job.finished"
// job.finished is also dictation's: the recording area only (hmcts.area, else the
// journey type's prefix).
| extend area = coalesce(tostring(customDimensions["hmcts.area"]),
    tostring(split(tostring(customDimensions["hmcts.journey.type"]), ".")[0]))
| where area == "recording"
| extend
    outcome = tostring(customDimensions["hmcts.outcome"]),
    source = tostring(customDimensions["hmcts.failure.source"])
| summarize
    succeeded = countif(outcome == "success"),
    unavailable = countif(outcome == "error"),
    failed_application = countif(outcome == "error" and source == "application"),
    failed_dependency = countif(outcome == "error" and source == "dependency"),
    failed_queue = countif(outcome == "error" and source == "queue"),
    client_failures = countif(outcome == "failure")
    by day = bin(timestamp, 1d), cloud_RoleName
| where succeeded + unavailable > 0
| extend availability_pct = round(100.0 * succeeded / (succeeded + unavailable), 3)
| order by day asc, cloud_RoleName asc
